{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;In Banjiha&gt;</strong> is a first\u2011person single\u2011player horror game.<br>\u201cBanjiha\u201d is the Korean term for semi\u2011basement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a room of a semi\u2011basement apartment building.\u2028<br>The door won\u2019t open.\u2028<br>Explore the dark, damp space and find a way out of this house\u2014<i>no matter what.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various objects to find ways to solve problems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.poster.avif?t=1772330239\" aria-label=\"It shows interaction with objects that appear in the game.\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.webm?t=1772330239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.mp4?t=1772330239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the house.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.poster.avif?t=1772330239\" aria-label=\"This shows scenes from the game. It features a semi-basement room in Korea, a dark corridor, a dirty boiler room, and a desolate kitchen.\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.webm?t=1772330239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.mp4?t=1772330239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a linear story \u2014 focus on a single goal and move forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time is about 1 hour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream, record, and upload content featuring any part of this game (including the beginning, ending, and credits).\u2028 Monetization activities such as donations and ad revenue are also allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not required to credit the game, but we truly appreciate it if you do.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506740?t=1772330239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/5a3bcc70a4b902956e248ae356f4a6c09dee4d7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772330239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/25491e1f959162dd4cbe179ab37798b126fb438b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772330239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506740/25491e1f959162dd4cbe179ab37798b126fb438b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772330239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud",